# PLANTPOTTING-0008 is an ASSESS-ONLY data-availability spike. NO training
# images are downloaded or committed. Any tiny off-repo eyeball sample lives
# OUTSIDE the project tree (a local scratch dir) and is never staged. This
# .gitignore is belt-and-braces: if a media file ever lands here by accident,
# git will not stage it. The committed deliverables are TEXT reports only
# (data-availability-report.md, source-counts.csv, query-log.md, etc.).

# Image / media — must never be committed by this sprint.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.tif

# Bulk-download / sample staging dirs — must never exist in the repo.
downloads/
samples/
raw/
eyeball/
scratch/

# API response caches (if a query helper ever caches to disk).
cache/
*.cache
*.json.cache
